                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c216ad58-3ff8-3d22-baa5-8bb58a1cc9ba",
                        "entry_id": "71762797-f769-3c0a-8057-f49673d49818",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif aux faits ou à ce qui est réel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29bebab0-22a7-4148-b84b-68df904a5c91",
                                "sense_id": "c216ad58-3ff8-3d22-baa5-8bb58a1cc9ba",
                                "text": "Après ce passage lyrique, le reste devenait plus factuel, et Jed feuilleta rapidement, cherchant juste à repérer les informations essentielles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8436e34-427d-48ed-b009-8df92e7644d2",
                                "sense_id": "c216ad58-3ff8-3d22-baa5-8bb58a1cc9ba",
                                "text": "La disposition des questions est aussi importante que les questions elles-mêmes, […]. Ainsi, les questions générales ont été posées avant les questions de contenu spécifique et les questions factuelles avant les questions d’opinion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d8a63a3-ddb0-4711-bc77-c1c044346c37",
                                "sense_id": "c216ad58-3ff8-3d22-baa5-8bb58a1cc9ba",
                                "text": "En conséquence, toutes les théories trouvaient une oreille intéressée, et les journalistes eurent l'embarras du choix pour rédiger des articles où l'étrange se disputait au sensationnel. Bientôt, les spéculations les plus folles prirent le pas sur l'aspect purement factuel des péripéties."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0494593b-0005-4fde-9b3a-b2450723a3c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "71762797-f769-3c0a-8057-f49673d49818",
                        "source_sense_id": "c216ad58-3ff8-3d22-baa5-8bb58a1cc9ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "factual",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "factual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40917894-e42e-3fba-bc2a-2c3eddaafe28",
                                        "entry_id": "5385b21c-0ac3-3d44-9bf6-45e486566b74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to or consisting of objective claims."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "964bf194-9f25-4ebb-9dce-20d25226fbbc",
                                                "sense_id": "40917894-e42e-3fba-bc2a-2c3eddaafe28",
                                                "text": "This hypothesis goes by many names, including group resistence, the threshold effect, and the gender paradox. Because the hypothesis holds such wide appeal, it is worth revisiting the logic behind it. The hypothesis is built on the factual observation that fewer females than males act antisocially."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f749fbff-cbca-406c-b980-6510921669aa",
                                                "sense_id": "40917894-e42e-3fba-bc2a-2c3eddaafe28",
                                                "text": "If, as Marx claimed, these factual views were held by the ideologists of the nineteenth century and if these factual claims could be proven false, then Marx could claim to have refuted certain tenets of capitalist political philosophy on a purely […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d41e89bf-a737-45b7-be69-b20941dba9c9",
                                                "sense_id": "40917894-e42e-3fba-bc2a-2c3eddaafe28",
                                                "text": "Thus, the approach has more flexibility than Lamarque and Olsen's approach; in particular, it is open to the possibility that false factual claims do affect our understanding of, and our evaluation of, fictional narratives."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3425f883-bb01-36c6-9189-1eef2b01f22b",
                                        "entry_id": "5385b21c-0ac3-3d44-9bf6-45e486566b74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "True, accurate, corresponding to reality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7827307-3c8d-4c2c-9a7d-8a93c2f1a108",
                                                "sense_id": "3425f883-bb01-36c6-9189-1eef2b01f22b",
                                                "text": "A book of this type is necessarily mainly factual, but it is diversified by many incidents and sidelights which help to give life to a story now accorded its due place in railway history."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "730296a8-a699-4cd9-a51f-ee049c815719",
                                                "sense_id": "3425f883-bb01-36c6-9189-1eef2b01f22b",
                                                "text": "He knew Guardian's real name. Did he dare play that card? \"Yes ma'am, that's factual information. All of it.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "factual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "768ee98c-001e-3c78-a58d-574fb43d4f3d",
                                        "entry_id": "6005aef0-dedb-3c23-bd1b-7ed780460140",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Programmes having content based on facts, such as documentaries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
